<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Sept 26.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Sept 26.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bright State (built 1989) 68,676 dwt del Hong Kong 5/10 3/5 mos. redel Japan $7,260 daily plus $125,000 bonus Korea Line.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
